<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JUNE 2/3.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JUNE 2/3.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Tuesday, June 3 on Monday. The</p>
<p>litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   03.06.97	  02.06.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.5350	    6.5516</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3344	    2.3502</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.5438	    4.5744</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.4426	    3.4355</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5171	    0.5172</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7746	    0.7793</p>
<p>    EKK	  0.2918	    0.2937</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.9875	    6.9912</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6930	    0.6934</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2465	    1.2488</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
